This is the changelog for the Siconos software, www.siconos.gforge.inria.fr.
Entries are written backwards. That is, items at the bottom
of the file were added first, and each subsequent addition is placed on a line
before it.
	Do not hesitate to use the emacs mode Change Log for editing this file


--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  v 2026-11
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This version complies with the siconos version 2026-11 (details in
RELEASE_NOTES.md).

Main Changes:
	* [examples] port to the siconos 2026-11 API: C++20 and namespaces,
	  Eigen algebra (SiconosMatrix), pybind11 python bindings (copy_t/alias_t),
	  lambdas instead of plugins loaded by name, renamed Lagrangian and
	  Newton-Euler relations, new numerics solver names
	* [examples/mechanics] mechanics_run with run_options (former keyword
	  arguments removed), energy and work outputs, restart
	* [examples/mechanics] new rock fall examples (digital elevation model,
	  height map, forest, propagation, rolling, Fremond law)
	* [examples/mechanics] new FEM examples (native T3/TH4, collision
	  detection, Hertz, Euler-Bernoulli beam, plastic beam, sparse impacting
	  bar), FEM/native reorganized (one directory per example)
	* [examples/mechanics] FEM plasticity: StripWithHole (Von Mises, plane
	  stress) and Footing (Mohr-Coulomb, plane strain), compared with
	  pytripopfem, Mandel notation in the outputs
	* [examples/mechanics] boundary conditions (BallOnMovingPlane), transport
	  cable, Fremond law examples, vkernel bouncing balls
	* [examples] both projection updates (RockingBlock) and impact rules
	  (SliderCrankD1MinusLinear), references checked after the scheme fixes
	* [tests] one ctest per example, short runs (SICONOS_EXAMPLES_SHORT_RUN),
	  relative comparisons with the references, Ubuntu 26.04 fixes
	* [examples] cppimport removed; former FEM plasticity examples
	  (T3-Footing, T3-GOSI-Plasticity) replaced by Plasticity/Footing and
	  Plasticity/StripWithHole

Known issues:
	* python control examples (examples/control/*/*.py) not updated, and no
	  control example is run by the tests (only the top of examples/control
	  is scanned); old references of TwoLinkManipulator_* C++ examples
	* jupyter notebooks (siconos-notebooks, examples/**/*.ipynb) not updated
	* Mechanisms examples (no python bindings), OCC examples using C plugins


--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  v 4.4.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This version complies with the siconos version 4.4.0

Main Changes:
	* [examples] add a rockfall example reading digital elevation map as a raster file
	* [examples] add masonry examples
	* [examples] update ref files with new Lie integration of NewtonEulerDS
	* [examples] mechanics/GranularMaterial add an example of hook to remove body w.r.t. a user logic
	* [sandbox]  Added DoubleMixture Drumboiler Example: MCP for phase change modelling and MLCS example



--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3.6.0 October 2013
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Main Changes:
	* Reference files have been added to several Examples.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3.5.0
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	* Propagate changes from Kernel: ioMatrix has moved from a class to a namespace
	* Biology : New examples from gene regulatory networks

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3.4.0
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	* Control/SMC: add simulations for each kind of SMC. For each c++ version,
	there is a corresponding Python version
	* Control/Relay: Add a Python version of Filippov
	* Fix casting in various examples
	* ColumnofBeads Add a simple example with dynamic graph

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3.3.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Main Changes:
	* Control/Relay. Add simulation with two models.
	* Mechanics/BouncingBall Add Bouncing BallTS with plugin and LagrangianR
	* Electronics/Circuit-ThetaGammaSchemes Add Examples with the Moreau
	ThetaGamma schemes on Circuits
	* Reference files. Add Reference files for comparison with reference
	results in Examples.
	* Mechanics/BouncingBallEventDriven. Add a new directory for ED
	simulations of the BB
	* Mechanics/ImpactingBeam Add example with Sparse Matrices


